001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (1.0% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000190632426000024/0001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 10.5% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000190632426000024/0001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-5.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000190632426000024/0001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $64.4m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000190632426000024/0001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"},{"text":"Debt of $2.9bn against equity of $1.9bn. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000190632426000024/0001906324-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001906324-26-000024"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1906324/000171787126000006/0001717871-26-000006-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfi